---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: All Guides
description: "Every board game guide on Game Night Guide: beginners, couples, 2 players, solo play, and head-to-head comparisons."
permalink: /guides/index.html
---

<div class="wrap">
<h1 style="text-align:center">All guides</h1>

<p class="lede" style="text-align:center">Every guide lists players, time, age and price, and says plainly when a price has not been verified.</p>

<div class="guide-list">
{% for post in collections.guides %}
  <article class="guide-item">
    {% if post.data.photo %}<a class="thumb" href="{{ post.url }}"><img src="{{ post.data.photo | replace('.jpg', '-thumb.jpg') }}" alt="" width="85" height="85" loading="lazy"></a>{% endif %}
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="dek">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <p><a class="read-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read More &rarr;</a></p>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
